<title>USA: NCR Corp extends small holder buyback offer.</title>
<headline>NCR Corp extends small holder buyback offer.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>NCR Corp said on Wednesday it extended until May 30 its offer to buy common shares from holders of 10 shares or less.</p>
<p>The offer originally was to expire February 28. Some odd-lot shareholders already have participated in the program, NCR said.</p>
<p>The offer price is based on the price of program transactions on five trading days after the First National Bank of Boston receives instructions from the investor's broker.</p>
<p>NCR said the intent of the offer is to provide a low-cost way for odd-lot shareowners to liquidate their holdings.</p>
</text>
